  "version": "0.7.6",
  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-005 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir. Version 0.7.6 fixes BP detection and follows the verified Ban/Pick View Plus route: it finds blue_picks/red_picks and pick_slot_N from relative UI/pass paths, preserves the actor NinePatch, clones it, and appends a 284x172 illustration overlay. Telemetry is now reserved for real BP candidates instead of being exhausted during startup. It also locks every elemental dragon attack pose to a constant frame-relative ground point, preventing widening breath canvases from walking the model forward. Native question cards, swap-phase state, and compact icons remain intact. The pack includes full-body encyclopedia portraits, image-generated objectives, neutral monsters, towers, Nexus crystals, League-style item art, and locally extracted official Baron audio for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
